  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral<math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> is",
