  "solution": {
    "text": "Note that&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Hence, the required integral is <math><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
